  "local_deviations": [
    "Static HTML/CSS/JavaScript adapter instead of direct @sgeo/ui-kit runtime components.",
    "Theme picker maps institutional, editorial, data/analytics, map and dark roles; Russian-authored interface copy is primary, with partial Kazakh and English chrome.",
    "DISARM-specific tab shell, matrices, playbook and modal compositions remain product-owned.",
    "Unicode glyphs and inline SVG are used instead of a complete named AVDS icon registry.",
    "DISARM object names and descriptions remain in their source language where no reviewed translation exists; Russian-authored guide copy is primary, and locale-specific disclosures appear in RU, KK and EN.",
    "Incident geography uses a disclosed external country-reference-point layer; DISARM supplies country labels only, so the map never asserts exact event locations and World remains list-only.",
    "The shared /_avds/avds.css dependency is hash-pinned, but its deployed bytes are not mapped to AVDS 4.7.0 source commit; the local static token export remains pinned to the earlier bda50683 source because an exact 79342b07 export was not available from an authoritative source.",
    "The requested qz.energy deviation list is outside this consumer contract; qz.energy must have its own manifest and evidence."
  ],
